oonup u$\">$u_k\\rightharpoonup u$</span>, if <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\langle u^*,u_k\\rangle \\to \\langle u^*,u\\rangle  \\]\">\\[  \\langle u^*,u_k\\rangle \\to \\langle u^*,u\\rangle  \\]</span> for every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u^*\\in X^*$\">$u^*\\in X^*$</span>. ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#sec:weak-convergence-appendix-d","next":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#rem:weak-convergence-basic-properties","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#def:bounded-linear-functional-dual-space","title":"def:bounded-linear-functional-dual-space","label":"def:bounded-linear-functional-dual-space"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#rem:weak-convergence-basic-properties","title":"rem:weak-convergence-basic-properties","label":"rem:weak-convergence-basic-properties"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#thm:weak-compactness-reflexive-banach","title":"thm:weak-compactness-reflexive-banach","label":"thm:weak-compactness-reflexive-banach"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#thm:mazurs-theorem","title":"thm:mazurs-theorem","label":"thm:mazurs-theorem"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#ex:weak-convergence-lp-duality","title":"ex:weak-convergence-lp-duality","label":"ex:weak-convergence-lp-duality"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#rem:compact-operator-weak-to-strong-convergence","title":"rem:compact-operator-weak-to-strong-convergence","label":"rem:compact-operator-weak-to-strong-convergence"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixD#def:weak-convergence","title":"def:weak-convergence","tex":"\\begin{definition}[Weak converg